+        // whose load is directly followed by another load (two joints feeding the seam triangles of a character)
+        // has no draw call of its own, is skipped by the ProjectionProcessor and keeps the unadjusted x scale. The
+        // limbs of one model then used different x scales ("sliced" character models).
+        // A perspective combined matrix (clip w depends on the position) belongs to the 3D scene: all such loads of a
